Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 19:22:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] S2: resolve session key and Google client secret from
 Secrets Manager

The API Lambda took GLIDE_SESSION_SECRET from a CloudFormation dynamic reference and both functions took GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET from the environment, so anyone able to read a function configuration could mint sessions or use the OAuth client. The functions now keep only secret ARNs and resolve the values in memory on cold start, with least-privilege IAM extended to the Google secret only.
